Python source — conceptual derivation
--------------------------------------

The physical-quantity layer (3 files: qcalc/qcore/qc_munit.py,
qc_mquantity.py, and qc_units.py) was written from scratch but takes
design cues from the PhysicalQuantities module in ScientificPython
by Konrad Hinsen <hinsen@cnrs-orleans.fr> and Greg Ward.
The code is a new implementation and is released under the MIT License.

Upstream reference:
  ScientificPython — Scientific/Physics/PhysicalQuantities.py
  https://github.com/khinsen/ScientificPython
